<title>NETHERLANDS: SLIGRO DETAILS 1996 STOCK DIVIDEND.</title>
<headline>SLIGRO DETAILS 1996 STOCK DIVIDEND.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Groceries wholesaler Sligro Beheer NV said on Monday it had set its 1996 optional stock dividend at one new share per 55 held.</p>
<p>On February 3, the company announced it would pay a 1996 cash dividend of 2.30 guilders, up from 2.00 in 1995, or an optional dividend in new shares.</p>
<p>Sligro's shares closed at 127.90 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Monday, down 0.60 from their previous close.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
